                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Just played through it in its current state, took me 44 mins, the puzzles were all logical and worked well, although i did have to guess 1 part.\n\nThe graphics are good, it has potential for exploration when more rooms are eventualy opened up, as you can teleport around the manion (only 1 puzzle room open atm)\n\nThe only thing i didnt like were the hand models, they are terrible lol.\n\nWould definatly recommend this if you like puzzles/escape rooms... yes 44 mins is not much game time, but remember its early access and they have promised to add more to it.\n\nGo get it whilst its on offer i say :-)",
